  triage:title "concurrent_recipient_adds_do_not_exceed_scope_cap races on shared-cache in-memory SQLite" ;
  triage:description "flaky-test-qa phase-ending critical review @ 9f5aef2fe. Finding: the test concurrent_recipient_adds_do_not_exceed_scope_cap races on a shared-cache in-memory SQLite connection; SQLITE_LOCKED is not retried, making the test intermittently flaky. Pre-existing on develop, not a Phase BA regression. fenix's ruling: fix on review-1 (cipher item 5): move to an on-disk WAL tempdir fixture with a 50x stress loop. Fixed at 92b34d11f, ACCEPTED by fenix." ;
